{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30845","headline":"送从叔重赴海南从事 · 马戴","name":"送从叔重赴海南从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"又从连帅请，还作岭南行。\n穷海何时到，孤帆累月程。\n乱蝉吟暮色，哀狖落秋声。\n晚路潮波起，寒葭雾雨生。\n沙埋铜柱没，山簇瘴云平。\n念此别离苦，其如宗从情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30845.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30845","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}